== Usage ==
A '''Plot Eraser''' can be used on an uncleared plot in {{zone|The Garden}} to consume it and instantly clean the plot with the following message:

{{Dialogue|
&aYour plot has been cleaned, and the &9Plot Eraser &ahas been consumed.
&aTime saved, mess gone!
}}

Using a '''Plot Eraser''' does not physically modify the plot.

